{"type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn6le10ob08re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le10ob08re2img03.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn6le10ob08re2img03.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0"}, {"image": "engenn6le10ob08re2img03.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Thank you for letting me chat with you for <span class=\"italic\">Cambridge Life</span> magazine. I haven't had the opportunity to meet a gentleman of your age. You would have seen a lot. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: I have seen a lot in my 100 years.<br>", "id": 1, "time": "100"}, {"image": "engenn6le10ob08re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I heard that you were in the Second World War.  <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>:  Yes, I was only 18 when I had to leave my family. I was part of the Western Front, you know.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You were very brave. How long were you there?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: Six months. The stress of combat was overwhelming, so I started smoking. Thank goodness I quit the nasty habit 30 years ago. I used to smoke a pack a day.<br>", "id": 2, "time": "12000"}, {"image": "", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: When did you return home?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>:  In 1945. I married my childhood sweetheart, Anne. Our twin boys, Robert and James, were born a couple years later. We later adopted Samuel, Grace and Albert.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You have a large family!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: Yes, they are now grown with families of their own.  <br>", "id": 3, "time": "38500"}, {"image": "", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You must eat well and exercise. What's your secret?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: I haven't had much illness in my later years. I believe in fresh air, a daily walk and a nice glass of port before bedtime.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You've had some interesting experiences in your life.", "id": 4, "time": "60500"}]}}], "id": 1}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "video", "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"video_src": "engenn6le10ob08re3vid01", "images": [{"image": "", "text": "Here are some examples of habits:<ul><li>smoking habits</li><li>sleeping habits</li><li>eating habits</li><li>study habits</li></ul>", "id": 0, "time": "5000"}, {"image": "", "text": "Here are some examples of sentences of using <span class=\"italic\">have had</span> and <span class=\"italic\">haven't had</span>:\n<span class=\"italic\"><ul><li>I haven't had much illness in my later years.</li>\n<li>I haven't had the opportunity to meet a gentleman of your age.</li>\n<li>You've had some wonderful experiences in your life.</li></ul></span>", "id": 1, "time": "60500"}]}}], "id": 2}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can write about family life.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can write experiences I've had or haven't had.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can write about past habits.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Do you have family members who are over 80 years old? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Do you ask them about their past experiences?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What do you think you can learn from the elderly?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"conte